nse","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["ecmascript","eslint","javascript","linter","static-code-analysis"],"visibility":"public","forks":4866,"open_issues":103,"watchers":26698,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/pulls/7438","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/pull/7438","diff_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/pull/7438.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/pull/7438.patch","merged_at":"2016-10-25T13:05:49Z"},"body":"**What is the purpose of this pull request? (put an \"X\" next to item)**\n\n[ ] Documentation update\n[x] Bug fix ([template](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eslint/eslint/master/templates/bug-report.md))\n[ ] New rule ([template](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eslint/eslint/master/templates/rule-proposal.md))\n[ ] Changes an existing rule ([template](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eslint/eslint/master/templates/rule-change-proposal.md))\n[ ] Add autofixing to a rule\n[ ] Add a CLI option\n[ ] Add something to the core\n[ ] Other, please explain:\n\nSee https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/7419\n\n<!--\n    Please ensure your pull request is ready:\n\n    - Read the pull request guide (http://eslint.org/docs/developer-guide/contributing/pull-requests)\n    - Include tests for this change\n    - Update documentation for this change (if appropriate)\n-->\n\n<!--\n    The following is required for all pull requests:\n-->\n\n**What changes did you make? (Give an overview)**\n\nThis fixes a bug in URL handling when generating the site.\n\nThe build script is designed to remove .md extensions from relative links:\n\n``` markdown\n[relative link](/foo/bar.md)\n\ngets fixed to:\n\n[relative link](/foo/bar)\n```\n\nHowever, there was a bug in the regex for cases like this:\n\n``` markdown\n[relative link](/foo/bar) other text [absolute link](https://github.com/foo.md)\n```\n\nThe regex was matching `) other text [absolute link](https://github.com/foo` as part of the original relative URL, so it thought the whole string was a single relative URL with a `.md` extension. So it was replacing the whole thing with this:\n\n``` markdown\n[relative link](/foo/bar) other text [absolute link](https://github.com/foo)\n```\n\nThis PR updates the regex to stop matching a URL after encountering the closing `)` character.\n- Fixes: https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/7419\n- Refs: https://github.com/eslint/eslint/pull/7222\n- Refs: https://github.com/eslint/eslint.github.io/pull/296\n\n**Is there anything you'd like reviewers to focus on?**\n\nNothing in particular.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/7438/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/7438/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":835421208,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50ODM1NDIxMjA4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/events/835421208","actor":{"login":"vitorbal","id":626038,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNjAzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/626038?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorbal","html_url":"https://github.com/vitorbal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorbal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorbal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorbal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorbal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorbal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitorbal/orgs","repos_url":"htt